name: sim.handleDynamics
description: Handles the dynamics functionality in a scene
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.handleDynamics(float deltaTime)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.handleDynamics(float deltaTime)
inputs:
1. deltaTime: simulation time step, i.e. sim.getSimulationTimeStep()
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the sepcified physics engine could not be found, otherwise the number of calculation steps performed by the physics engine.
